WEBVTT

00:00:59.954 --> 00:01:01.579
I like to go to different places.

00:01:01.579 --> 00:01:02.787
Like, I travel a lot.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:04.579
I was in the South not too long ago.

00:01:04.579 --> 00:01:07.954
I love the South because
everybody’s very suspiciously kind.

00:01:08.204 --> 00:01:09.871
(Laughter)

00:01:10.204 --> 00:01:11.371
Yeah, I’m from New York;

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:12.704
we don’t trust kindness.

00:01:12.746 --> 00:01:14.163
(Laughter)

00:01:14.204 --> 00:01:15.413
I love the accent, too.

00:01:15.413 --> 00:01:17.746
I’m a sucker for the Southern accent.

00:01:17.788 --> 00:01:19.121
I think it’s so charming.

00:01:19.163 --> 00:01:20.788
Like last time I was in the South,

00:01:20.829 --> 00:01:22.371
I was leaving this Starbucks,

00:01:22.371 --> 00:01:24.246
and this guy held the door open for me.

00:01:24.246 --> 00:01:25.871
And first of all, I’m so damaged.

00:01:25.871 --> 00:01:27.538
I was like, “I do deserve love.

00:01:27.538 --> 00:01:28.538
Thank you!”

00:01:28.538 --> 00:01:30.329
(Laughter)